sgx: an option for the DDK services backend

The sgx winsys talks to powervr_sgx. -Dgallium-sgx-pvrsrvkm=true also builds its
backend for the DDK's services kernel driver (pvrsrvkm), from libpvr and the
kernel driver's headers. Off by default; not for upstream.

--- a/meson.options
+++ b/meson.options
@@ -915,3 +915,12 @@
   value : false,
   description : 'Build panfrost Rust components.'
 )
+
+option(
+  'gallium-sgx-pvrsrvkm',
+  type : 'boolean',
+  value : false,
+  description : 'sgx: also build the winsys backend for the DDK\'s services ' +
+                'kernel driver (pvrsrvkm). Needs libpvr and the kernel ' +
+                'driver\'s headers linked into the tree.',
+)
